title: Tractors on the Autobahn
subtitle: Farmers are blockading roads over costs and EU rules...
view-if: time >= 3 and month >= 1 and month <= 3 and spd_in_government and agricultural_finance < 2
max-visits: 1
on-arrival: agricultural_crisis_seen = 1; rural_bsw += 1; rural_spd -= 2; rural_afd += 2
new-page: true
tags: event
face-image: img/Kollwitz_bauernkrieg.jpg

= Tractors on the Autobahn

For the second winter in a row, farmers are blocking motorway slip roads and city centres with their tractors. They are angry about the end of the diesel subsidy, the costs of new animal-welfare and fertiliser rules, and cheap imports under the EU's Mercosur agreement. Most protesters are peaceful, but far-right groups have joined the convoys, and some protests have turned on local SPD offices.

What should we do?

- @nothing: There is nothing we can do.
- @suppress: The blockades are illegal. Have the police clear the roads.
- @financing_1: Extend the relief package for farms.
- @financing_2: Offer a relief package for farms.

@nothing
on-arrival: rural_afd += 3; rural_spd -= 2; rural_greens -= 2; trust_in_democracy -= 3

We wait for the protests to burn out. They do, slowly, but the AfD and the Freie Wähler are happy to channel the farmers' anger into a wider revolt against "Berlin".

@suppress
unavailable-subtitle: The police and the Länder are unwilling to break up the protests.
choose-if: federal_police_loyalty >= 0.6 or verfassungsschutz_loyalty >= 0.6
on-arrival: rural_spd -= 4; rural_greens -= 3; rural_afd -= 2

The police clear the blockades, and the far-right hangers-on lose their stage. But the farmers' costs have not gone down, and many of them will not forgive the SPD.

@financing_1
subtitle: -1 budget - we have already helped the farms, but more support is still needed.
choose-if: budget >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: -1 budget - we do not have the funds.
view-if: agricultural_finance == 1
on-arrival: budget -= 1; agricultural_finance += 1; rural_policy += 1
go-to: financing_done

@financing_2
subtitle: -2 budget
choose-if: budget >= 2
unavailable-subtitle: -2 budget - we do not have the funds.
view-if: agricultural_finance < 1
on-arrival: budget -= 2; rural_spd += 2*(1-dissent); coalition_dissent += 1; center_dissent += 3; agricultural_finance += 1; rural_policy += 1
go-to: financing_done

@financing_done
on-arrival: rural_spd += 3*(1-dissent); rural_greens += 2 if greens_in_government

We put together a relief package: cheaper agricultural diesel for three years, help with the cost of new barns, and a fairer share of the supermarket price for producers. Most farmers' associations accept it and call off the blockades. Some in the coalition see it as giving in to pressure from the street and as a blow to the budget.
